  "processing": [
    "Original raster retained unchanged as ZIP; uncompressed E00 grid converted to GeoTIFF with record-width, row-padding, dimension and elevation-range checks.",
    "Native 1 m masks from 2018 gauged catchment polygons; NoData=-9999; DEFLATE GeoTIFF.",
    "2018 catchment boundaries independently derived from 2016 lidar; 2008 clips do not reproduce their delineation.",
    "Full source footprint aggregated to approximately 10 m by average resampling.",
    "Hillshade at 315 degree azimuth, 45 degree altitude, unit vertical exaggeration; warped to EPSG:4326 only for display.",
    "Stream geometries simplified at 3 m in EPSG:26910 and exported to WGS84.",
    "Surveyed areas from HF004 histories retained separately from polygon areas."
  ],
  "excluded": [
    "discharge time series",
    "climate time series",
